        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard transit time is 5‑7 days, depending on traffic, weather, and checkpoint clearances along the National Highway corridors. Our dedicated fleet follows pre‑planned routes on multi‑axle express freight highways, minimizing delays. Real‑time GPS tracking keeps you informed of any schedule adjustments.</p>
