      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike fully insured while it travels between Bangalore and Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. In the unlikely event of damage or loss, we settle claims in full. The insurance premium is included in the quoted price, so there are no hidden costs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I monitor my bike’s location during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our GPS‑enabled containers provide live tracking accessible via a secure portal or SMS alerts. You receive real‑time updates at key milestones—pickup, en‑route checkpoints, and delivery—ensuring complete visibility of your bike transport from Bangalore to Chandigarh.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to ship a bike from Bangalore to Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid registration certificate, a copy of your PAN or Aadhaar for identity verification, a signed consignment note, and the insurance declaration form. If the bike is under a loan, a No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) from the financier is also required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on the type or size of bike that can be shipped on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We handle all standard two‑wheelers, including sport, commuter, and cruiser models up to 250 kg GVW. Oversized or custom‑built bikes may need special crating, which we can arrange at an additional cost. Exotic or vintage bikes receive extra protective measures and dedicated handling.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
